/T (Dear Hiring Manager, I am excited to apply for the MERN Stack Developer position at your company. With over 3 years of experience in full stack web and mobile application development I have built scalable high performance applications using React.js Next.js Node.js NestJS Express.js MongoDB React Native TypeScript and JavaScript. My expertise includes developing responsive user interfaces building secure REST APIs implementing JWT authentication role based access control integrating third party APIs and creating real time applications with Socket.IO. I have strong experience with Redux Toolkit Tailwind CSS Shadcn UI Firebase Git GitHub Docker MySQL PostgreSQL Prisma and cloud services. I am passionate about writing clean maintainable and scalable code while delivering fast secure and user friendly applications. Throughout my career I have collaborated with designers developers QA teams and clients in Agile environments to deliver projects on time and according to business requirements. I enjoy solving complex technical challenges optimizing application performance and continuously learning modern technologies to build better software. I have attached my resume for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.)
/E (Dear Hiring Manager, I am excited to apply for the MERN Stack Developer position at your company. With over 3 years of experience in full stack web and mobile application development I have built scalable high performance applications using React.js Next.js Node.js NestJS Express.js MongoDB React Native TypeScript and JavaScript. My expertise includes developing responsive user interfaces building secure REST APIs implementing JWT authentication role based access control integrating third party APIs and creating real time applications with Socket.IO. I have strong experience with Redux Toolkit Tailwind CSS Shadcn UI Firebase Git GitHub Docker MySQL PostgreSQL Prisma and cloud services. I am passionate about writing clean maintainable and scalable code while delivering fast secure and user friendly applications. Throughout my career I have collaborated with designers developers QA teams and clients in Agile environments to deliver projects on time and according to business requirements. I enjoy solving complex technical challenges optimizing application performance and continuously learning modern technologies to build better software. I have attached my resume for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.)
